# Quick controls on the PDA profile's portrait panels (480x800 = the Pi 3A+ DSI turned, 480x640 = a 3.5" panel turned):
# the home grid with its tile, the page opened, Wi-Fi switched off. 2 x 2, buttons never taller than wide, centred in
# the room under the header. Review only: no golden.
title pda quick controls
review
sizes 480x640 480x800
profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_PDA 0
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_QUICKCTL_ADAPTERS all
apps Settings CLI "Quick controls" SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
header home
shot pda_qc_home
launch "Quick controls"
wait 600
shot pda_qc_open
header pda_qc_open "Controls"
expect_text Shutdown
key ENTER
wait 400
shot pda_qc_wifi_off
expect_radio wifi off
expect_power none
